  "title": "Lucy's Ham Spread",
  "description": "A favorite old-fashioned ham spread is flavored with tomato and processed cheese. It gets a firm texture from a little bit of instant tapioca.",
  "authors": [
    "Barb Wahnsiedler Klein"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:48:16-04:00",
